        <mxCell id="pl07ghJkXNtjpxfqh3xb-28" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="for TTU as well as for DOU:&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;either &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: rgb(204, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;no signficant effect&lt;/span&gt;, or group effect is combined with a significant interaction between group and task_id&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;-&amp;gt; no global CLD possible, instead one has to rely on the task-specific findings&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
